# The repository stores text as LF. Declare it so every checkout materialises LF
# regardless of the contributor's core.autocrlf setting. Without this, a Windows
# clone (core.autocrlf=true) writes CRLF working files and `bun run lint` reports
# a prettier/prettier "Delete `CR`" error on essentially every line of every file,
# which makes the lint gate unusable locally even though CI (Linux) is green.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.gz   binary
*.pdf  binary
